{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19717","headline":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 三 · 吕温","name":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早秋同轨至，晨斾露华滋。\n挽度千夫咽，笳凝六马迟。\n劒悲长闭日，衣望出游时。\n风起西陵树，凄凉满孝思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}